{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UCk747dUHqpM4yq323iX8w","type":"tool_result","content":"544:- `game.settings`: the player's choices (game.settings.volume, game.settings.set('volume', .5), your own from menu.settings), saved and applied (section 10b)\n544:- `game.settings`: the player's choices (game.settings.volume, game.settings.set('volume', .5), your own from menu.settings), saved and applied (section 10b)\n1106:- `new E.Dialog(game, o = {}) → talk`: new E.Dialog(game, { speed, lines, place, color, nameColor, voice, bg, border, vars }): a dialog box that types its text; say() opens it, update(dt) and draw(r) run it\n565:- `settings.define(sp)`: add a setting: { key, label, type: 'toggle' | 'slider' | 'select', value, min, max, step, options: [[value, label]] or [value], help, group: 'Game', apply(game, value) }. Its saved value is loaded (when it is a valid one) and applied; it shows on the settings screen. Ret\n566:- `settings.keys(group)`: the keys of a group's settings, in order ('Display', 'Sound', 'Comfort', 'Controller', 'Touch', 'Game'), or every key\n714:- `blob.draw(g, ox, oy, view)`: draw(g, ox, oy, view). Creature features from the constructor options: ears: 'rabbit' | 'cat', horns: true, wings: true (flapping bat wings), feet: true, tail: true, mouth: true | 'fangs', face: 'front' (eyes always on the camera side, for Mana-style monsters) upd\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium__20261102-190205__xac1bf5/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"41d7e7a4-7a0c-4c1d-8249-64635219af5f","uuid":"86df3eb2-54ad-4cb9-bba4-916e57e9e88f","timestamp":"2026-11-03T02:05:56.380Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"544:- `game.settings`: the player's choices (game.settings.volume, game.settings.set('volume', .5), your own from menu.settings), saved and applied (section 10b)\n544:- `game.settings`: the player's choices (game.settings.volume, game.settings.set('volume